BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_314286578@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260430T035342Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260504T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260504T220000
SUMMARY:Game Night @ Archetype West Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\n\\*\\*This is a collaboration 
 with the Asheville's Bored Game Geeks\\*\\*\n\nBring your favorite game(s)
  or learn a new one – members are always happy to teach! See you there a
 nd have a blast!\n**Welcome to the Game Night Extravaganza!**\n\nCalling a
 ll dice-rollers\, card-shufflers\, and strategy-curious adventurers!\nAre 
 weeknights feeling a tad mundane? Fear not! We’ve got the antidote: **Bo
 ard Games\, Brews\, and Bliss**.\n\n**Our Mission:** To ignite laughter\, 
 forge alliances\, and maybe—just maybe—unleash a few friendly rivalrie
 s & battle to the death!\nNo PhD in rulebooks required! Whether you’re a
  Settlers of Catan enthusiast or a Code Names solving ninja\, or your firs
 t time touching a board game ***we will explain all the rules needed.***\n
 \nExpect:\n\n* **Beer on Tap**: Because rolling dice is better with a pint
  in hand.\n* **Low Brainpower Required**: We’re all about fun\, not Ferm
 at’s Last Theorem.\n* **Epic Showdowns**: Ticket to Ride routes\, Splend
 or gem heists\, and High stakes Camel Up.\n\nFeel free to request any game
  you’d like to play or bring your own. So gather your guild\, stack your
  resource cards\, and let the games begin! May your laughter be loud\, you
 r moves be bold\, and your victory dances be legendary.\n\nSee you at the 
 table!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /314286578/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260414T225102Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260414T225102Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_314438065@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260430T035342Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260508T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260508T220000
SUMMARY:Let's Take Swing Dance Lessons
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nJoin us for Asheville Swing Ni
 ght on **May 8th** for an evening of swing dancing\, great music\, and a f
 un beginner-friendly lesson. 💃🕺\n\nWe’re changing up the lesson fo
 rmat a bit this month based on feedback we received\, and we think you’r
 e going to love it.\n\nDeb and Franklin will kick things off with the begi
 nner fundamentals so everyone can learn the basic 6-count footwork and get
  comfortable with swing dancing. 🎶\n\nThen\, those who want to learn mo
 re can branch off with them to learn a few fun next-step moves\, while the
  rest of us continue practicing in a relaxed group with help from our expe
 rienced dance assistants.\n\nNo partner needed. During both the lesson and
  social dance\, most people rotate partners\, making it a fun and easy way
  to meet people and get comfortable in the space.\n\n(Most people come alo
 ne\, by the way.)\n\n**What dance are we learning?**\nIntro Lindy Hop and 
 East Coast Swing.\n\n**How many people come?**\nWe typically have 55–65 
 people\, and some months much more. It’s open to the public\, not just t
 his Meetup group.\n\n**What should I wear?**\nWear shoes that are comforta
 ble to dance in. Heels are not recommended. Leather-soled shoes or comfort
 able sneakers are best. Dressing up is optional - people wear everything f
 rom casual to vintage-inspired outfits.\n\n## Logistics\n\n📍 **Location
 :** Haw Creek Commons\nParking is onsite\, or at Haw Creek Elementary if t
 he lot is full. Just walk across the field to the venue.\n\n🕖 **7:00 PM
  sharp** — Beginner swing dance lesson\n(Please arrive on time\, as the 
 lesson builds progressively and is harder to join late if you're brand new
 .)\n\n💃🕺 **8:00 PM – 10:30 PM** — Social dance with DJ\n\n💵 *
 *$10 admission** includes both the lesson and dance\nPay at the door (cash
  or Venmo)\n\n🚪 Doors open at 6:45 PM\n\n👥 Ages 12+\n\n**More Info:*
 *\nFacebook Event:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/792420760292163/\n\nWe
 bsite: [https://ashevilleswingnight.com/](https://ashevilleswingnight.com/
 )
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /314438065/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260423T141610Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260423T141610Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
